WEBVTT

00:01:57.773 --> 00:02:00.734
Companies can even give control to hackers.

00:02:00.734 --> 00:02:03.185
When Microsoft Kinect came out,

00:02:03.185 --> 00:02:07.336
the motion-controlled add-on to its Xbox gaming console,

00:02:07.336 --> 00:02:10.272
it immediately drew the attention of hackers.

00:02:10.272 --> 00:02:14.165
Microsoft first fought off the hacks, but then shifted course

00:02:14.165 --> 00:02:17.028
when it realized that actively supporting the community

00:02:17.028 --> 00:02:18.787
came with benefits.

00:02:18.787 --> 00:02:22.023
The sense of co-ownership, the free publicity,

00:02:22.023 --> 00:02:25.040
the added value, all helped drive sales.

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:27.369
The ultimate empowerment of customers

00:02:27.369 --> 00:02:30.462
is to ask them not to buy.